  "description": "Error/timeout infrastructure for CanKit (CanKit.Pro): a reusable actor-driven deadline primitive (DeadlineScheduler/Deadline) whose expiry is guaranteed to actually be checked and fired, plus a BusStateMonitor that pushes ICanBus.BusState transitions (ErrWarning/ErrPassive/BusOff and recovery) to protocol instances — composed on top of CanKit.Pro.Actor's single-mailbox loop, with no free-running timers or busy loops.",
